        </greek>
      </verse>
      <verse num="21">
        <text>Confident of your obedience, I write to you, knowing that you will do even more than I say.</text>
        <greek>
          <w lemma="πείθω">πεποιθὼς</w>
          <w lemma="ὁ">τῇ</w>
          <w lemma="ὑπακοή">ὑπακοῇ</w>
